        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha mfalume Hezekiya achiaika Alawi kpwenye Nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu. Nao achiwewa matoazi, vinanda, na ngephephe sawa-sawa na arivyolagiza mfalume Daudi, Gadi, muonadzi wa mfalume, na nabii Nathani. Hivyo ndivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyolagiza kutsupira manabiige. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyo Alawi aima tayari na miyo yotengezwa ni Daudi na hinyo alavyadzi-sadaka nao aima na tarumbeta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Hezekiya achialagiza iyo sadaka ya kuochwa ilaviwe hipho phatu pha kulavira sadaka. Nayo iriphoandza kuochwa wira wa Mwenyezi Mlungu nao uchiandzwa kuimbwa phamwenga na tarumbeta na miyo yanjina yotengezwa ni Daudi, mfalume wa Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hiro borori ra atu rosi richiabudu, avwinadzi achivwina, enye tarumbeta achizipiga. Ichienderera hivyo hadi achimala kulavya sadaka ya kuochwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphomala kulavya iyo sadaka ya kuochwa, mfalume na atu osi ariokala hipho azama hadi vilangu vyao vichiguta photsi achiabudu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona mfalume Hezekiya na akulu achiamuru Alawi avwine kumtogola Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa maneno ga Daudi na ga muonadzi Asafu. Avwina kumtogola Mlungu na furaha na achizamisa vitswa vyao, achiabudu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Hezekiya achiamba, “Kpwa kukala ndipho mkadziika atakatifu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, sengerani phephi mrehe sadaka na mulavye shukurani nyumbani mwa Mwenyezi Mlungu.” Phahi hinyo atu areha sadaka zao na achilavya shukurani zao. Hara ariokala na moyo wa kulavya, areha nyama a kulaviwa sadaka za kuochwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isabu ya sadaka zirizorehwa ni ndzau mirongo sabaa na maturume gana mwenga na ana ngʼondzi magana mairi. Hizi zosi zarehwa kukala sadaka za kuochwa kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyo atu piya areha ndzau magana sita na mangʼondzi elufu tahu zikale sadaka kpwa Mlungu ili aphahe kubarikiwa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela taphayakala na alavyadzi-sadaka a kutosha a kuweza kutsuna nyama osi hinyo a sadaka za kuochwa. Hipho Alawi ambao kala ni adugu aho aaterya hadi kazi ichisira na hadi alavyadzi-sadaka anjina ariphodzitakasa. Alawi kala ana chadi cha kudzitakasa kuriko alavyadzi-sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha phamwenga na unji wa hizo sadaka za kuochwa, kala phana marunya ga sadaka za amani na sadaka za vinwadzi kpwa chila sadaka ya kuochwa. Kpwa hivyo huduma kpwenye nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu yauyizwa luphya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Hezekiya na atu osi ahererwa sana kpwa ajili ya gara ambago Mwenyezi Mlungu wahendera hinyo atu na kpwa kukala chila chitu chahendwa mara mwenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
